  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. Measurements of correlations between event-by-event fluctuations\nof amplitudes of anisotropic flow harmonics in nucleus-nucleus collisions\nat $\\sqrt{s_{_{\\rm NN}}}=5.02$ TeV. The measurements are performed in the\ncentral pseudorapidity region (|$\\eta$| < 0.8) and transverse momentum\nrange 0.2 < $p_T$ < 5.0 GeV/c.\n",
